<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy" %>

<!-- Privacy Policy Page -->
<div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="px-6 py-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-700 text-black">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-black-100">Effective Date: <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="px-6 py-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

        <!-- About this policy Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">About this policy</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              This privacy policy is for this website and governs the privacy of users who choose to use it. 
              This policy sets out how we collect, process, and protect your personal information when you use our schools listing service.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring that your personal information is handled in a safe and responsible manner.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- The website Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">The website</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              This website and its owners take a proactive approach to user privacy and ensure that necessary steps are taken 
              to protect the privacy of users throughout their visiting experience. We implement appropriate technical and 
              organizational measures to safeguard your personal data.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Our commitment to privacy extends to all aspects of our service, including how we collect, store, process, 
              and share your information when you search for schools, contact educational institutions, or use our interactive features.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Use of Cookies Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">Use of Cookies</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              This website may use cookies to better the user's experience while visiting the website. Where applicable, 
              this website uses a cookie control system allowing the user on their first visit to the website to allow or 
              disallow the use of cookies on their computer/device. This complies with recent legislation requirements for 
              websites to obtain explicit consent from users before leaving behind or reading files such as cookies on a 
              user's computer/device.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-6 my-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-3">Types of Cookies We Use:</h3>
              
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-medium text-blue-800 mb-2">Location and Preferences Cookies</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">
                    We store your home location and search preferences locally on your device to provide distance calculations 
                    and personalized school recommendations. These cookies help us remember your location settings so you don't 
                    have to enter them repeatedly. These cookies expire after 30 days.
                  </p>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-medium text-blue-800 mb-2">Authentication Cookies</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">
                    If you create an account or log in to contact schools, we will set up several cookies to save your login 
                    information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days and screen options cookies 
                    last for a year. If you select "Remember Me," your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of 
                    your account, the login cookies will be removed.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-medium text-blue-800 mb-2">Session Cookies</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">
                    If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. 
                    This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-medium text-blue-800 mb-2">Contact Form Cookies</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">
                    If you contact a school through our platform, you may opt-in to save your name, email address, and basic 
                    information in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again 
                    when contacting other schools. These cookies will last for one year.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-medium text-blue-800 mb-2">Content Interaction Cookies</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">
                    If you interact with school content, leave reviews, or bookmark schools, an additional cookie may be saved 
                    in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates your interactions to provide 
                    a better user experience. It expires after 1 day.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Links Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">Links</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              The owners of this website cannot guarantee or verify the contents of any externally linked website despite 
              their best efforts. Users should, therefore, note that they click on external links at their own risk and 
              this website and its owners cannot be held liable for any damages or implications caused by visiting any 
              external links mentioned.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Although this website only looks to include quality, safe, and relevant external links to school websites, 
              official education resources, and trusted educational content, users are advised to adopt a policy of caution 
              before clicking any external web links mentioned throughout this website. External links may lead to school 
              websites, educational institutions, government education departments, or other educational resources that have 
              their own privacy policies and terms of use.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                <strong>Note:</strong> External links are clickable text, buttons, or image links to other websites, 
                including school websites, application portals, and educational resources.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Social Media Platforms Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">Social Media Platforms</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Communication, engagement, and actions taken through external social media platforms that this website and 
              its owners participate in are custom to the terms and conditions as well as the privacy policies held with 
              each social media platform respectively.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              This includes but is not limited to Facebook login integration, sharing school information on social platforms, 
              and any social media features embedded on school profiles. When you use social media features on our platform, 
              you are also subject to the privacy policies of those social media companies.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-4 mt-4">
              <h4 class="font-medium text-blue-900 mb-2">Facebook Integration</h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">
                When you use Facebook to log in or authenticate, we may receive basic profile information such as your name, 
                email address, and profile picture. This information is used solely to create and maintain your account and 
                improve your user experience. We comply with Facebook's data use policies and your Facebook privacy settings.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Embedded content Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">Embedded content from other websites</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              School profiles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, virtual tours, maps, etc.). 
              Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your 
              interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have 
              an account and are logged in to that website.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3 mt-4">
              <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4">
                <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2">Common Embedded Content:</h4>
                <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
                  <li>• School virtual tours and 360° videos</li>
                  <li>• Google Maps showing school locations</li>
                  <li>• YouTube videos showcasing school facilities</li>
                  <li>• School social media feeds</li>
                  <li>• Online application forms and portals</li>
                  <li>• Educational content and resources</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Data Retention Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">How long we retain your data</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              If you leave a comment or review on a school profile, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. 
              This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a 
              moderation queue.
            </p>
            
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              For users that register on our website, we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. 
              All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except for their username, which they 
              cannot change). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-lg p-6 mt-4">
              <h4 class="font-medium text-yellow-900 mb-3">Data Retention Periods:</h4>
              
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800">Location Data (stored locally)</span>
                  <span class="text-sm text-yellow-700">30 days</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800">Login Sessions</span>
                  <span class="text-sm text-yellow-700">2 days (2 weeks with "Remember Me")</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800">User Profiles</span>
                  <span class="text-sm text-yellow-700">Until account deletion</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800">Contact Form Data</span>
                  <span class="text-sm text-yellow-700">1 year (if opted in)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-yellow-800">School Reviews/Comments</span>
                  <span class="text-sm text-yellow-700">Indefinitely (unless requested for deletion)</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Data Deletion Section -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">How can I delete my personal data?</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              If you wish to delete any personal data or any other data that belongs to you and for some reason cannot find 
              a way to accomplish this through your account settings, please contact our data compliance officer using the 
              contact information provided below.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-lg p-6 mt-4">
              <h4 class="font-medium text-green-900 mb-3">Your Data Rights:</h4>
              
              <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-green-800">
                <p><strong>Right to Access:</strong> You can request a copy of all personal data we hold about you.</p>
                <p><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> You can correct any inaccurate or incomplete personal data.</p>
                <p><strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> You can request deletion of your personal data under certain circumstances.</p>
                <p><strong>Right to Data Portability:</strong> You can request your data in a machine-readable format.</p>
                <p><strong>Right to Withdraw Consent:</strong> You can withdraw consent for data processing at any time.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 mt-4">
              <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">How to Delete Your Data:</h4>
              
              <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
                <div>
                  <strong>Location Data:</strong> Clear your browser's local storage or use the "Clear Location" button in Settings.
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong>Account Data:</strong> Log into your account and use the account deletion option in your profile settings.
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong>Contact Form Data:</strong> Submit a data deletion request using the contact information below.
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong>Comments/Reviews:</strong> Contact us to request removal of specific comments or reviews you have posted.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact Information -->
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b-2 border-blue-500">Contact Information</h2>
          
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2">Data Protection Inquiries</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-700">
                  For questions regarding this Privacy Policy, data protection, or to exercise your data rights, 
                  please contact our data compliance officer.
                </p>
              </div>
              
              <div class="pt-3 border-t border-gray-300">
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                  <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:dpo@connectica.no" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">dpo@connectica.no</a>
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">
                  We will respond to all data protection inquiries within 30 days.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>